  "type": "feat",
  "name": "Divide (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a standard action, the field specialist can bring his blade up with an upward strike, blowing away a target. He makes a single melee attack against a target within reach and, if successful, he deals normal melee weapon damage with his gun arm plus his gun arm’s firearm damage to the target and the field specialist gets a free trip attempt on the target. The field specialist is not tripped in return if he fails. If the target is immune to being tripped, it is instead pushed back 5 feet, if able.</p>",
